    {
      "name": "add-to-list",
      "kind": "write",
      "description": "Add a person or company to a list as a new entry with no entry values (set them with update-entry). Read back by entry id; the parent record id must match. Limitation: Attio allows several entries for the same record and has no idempotency, so a retry after an unknown outcome can add the record twice.",
